OL,3,GNEWSARock barrier plans progress for
OL,4,Alandmark beach
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to build a rock barrier on a
OL,7,FDorset beach that is part of a Unesco
OL,8,FWorld Heritage Site have moved forward.
OL,10,FCouncillors have approved an #11m
OL,11,Fbusiness case for the work at Chesil
OL,12,FCove, Portland.
OL,14,FThe southern end of the existing sea
OL,15,Fwall could fail during the next
OL,16,Fsignificant storm, a council cabinet
OL,17,Fmeeting was told.
OL,19,FThe existing sea barrier, built in
OL,20,F1965, has a promenade, with steps
OL,21,Fleading down a sloping rock wall to the
OL,22,Fshingle beach.
